# The wood fracture clip of a content set: our harbour barrel, then our crate, broken by the
# native one-handed attack. Each prop: a close "intact" frame, a take from the blow until the
# pieces sleep, then the close "pieces" frame from the same camera. `destruction2_pieces`
# gives the guards 0.5..15 s after the break. The hero strikes towards +z; the blow opens the
# +x/-z quarter, so both cameras stand on that side at an angle (the hero is on their left).
# The lunge leaves the hero inside the prop: after the take `destruction2 stand` puts him back
# where he stood before the blow, so the close "pieces" frame shows the breach.
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
movable on
living on
noise on
destruction on
overlay off
ui off
view full

destruction2 setup barrel 1h
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot barrel-close-before
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 800
shot barrel-side-before
wait 100
rec barrel-side
destruction2 attack
wait 10000
stop
destruction2 checkpoint
wait 4500
destruction2 stand
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot barrel-close-after
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 300
shot barrel-side-after
wait 100

destruction2 setup crate 1h
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot crate-close-before
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 800
shot crate-side-before
wait 100
rec crate-side
destruction2 attack
wait 10000
stop
destruction2 checkpoint
wait 4500
destruction2 stand
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot crate-close-after
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 300
shot crate-side-after
wait 100
